name:           markdown-render
version:        0.0.0.0
synopsis:       Build CommonMark documents as values and render them safely
description:    Build a CommonMark document as a value, out of text that may contain anything, and render it with every character that would change its meaning escaped.
                .
                For more info, see <https://github.com/NorfairKing/markdown-render the readme>.
category:       Text
homepage:       https://github.com/NorfairKing/markdown-render#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/NorfairKing/markdown-render/issues
author:         Tom Sydney Kerckhove
maintainer:     syd@cs-syd.eu
